// The laptop as the shell draws it: open, seen from the front.
//
// WHY IT IS A SEPARATE PREFAB. The laptop in the world is a closed body with
// the lid as a child entity that a DoorComponent swings. An ItemPreviewWidget
// renders a prefab from scratch, so it would render that laptop shut -- which
// is what it did, and a shut laptop is a poor thing to lay a screen on. This
// is the same model posed open and baked into one mesh, LaptopOpen.xob.
//
// WHY IT INHERITS Item_Base. It was a bare GenericEntity with a MeshObject on
// it, which renders, and then quietly does not do the one other thing the
// shell needs: TryGetItemNodePositionInWidgetSpace answered nothing, so
// MCF_Device_Layout could never find out where in its box the laptop actually
// ended up. The glass then stayed sized against the BOX, which the model fills
// only about two thirds of -- so the screen came out half again too big and
// covered the entire laptop. What you saw was the preview widget's black
// background around a panel, with the laptop hidden behind it.
//
// The phone's preview prefab is the phone itself, an Item_Base, and its
// measurement has always worked. That is the whole difference, so this one is
// an Item_Base too. Measured, in engine axes: 0.3608 across, 0.2274 tall,
// 0.3514 deep -- which is the 0.36 x 0.227 face m_vPreviewSize declares.
//
// CameraOrbitAngles is PITCH, yaw, roll. Zero looks horizontally at the
// standing screen. The phone uses 90 because a phone lies flat and has to be
// looked down at; a laptop screen is already facing you.
GenericEntity : "{C95E11C60810F432}Prefabs/Items/Core/Item_Base.et" {
 ID "6A1C4F0B39D2D090"
 components {
  MeshObject "{6A1C4F0B39D2D091}" {
   Object "{A83A4C59D97ED743}Assets/Props/Intel/Laptop/LaptopOpen.xob"
  }
  InventoryItemComponent "{5222EB4D0C73006B}" {
   Attributes SCR_ItemAttributeCollection "{5222EB4D0A2B466B}" {
    ItemDisplayName UIInfo "{5222EB4D07D865FA}" {
     Name "Laptop"
    }
    CustomAttributes {
     PreviewRenderAttributes "{6A1C4F0B39D2D093}" {
      CameraOrbitAngles 0 0 0
      CameraDistanceToItem 0.36
      ItemRenderRotation 0 0 0
      LodModel 1
     }
    }
    m_Size SLOT_1x1
    m_SlotType SLOT_LOADOUT_STORAGE
   }
  }
  Hierarchy "{6A1C4F0B39D2D092}" {
  }
 }
}
